concept:data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022-sch-2-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 Applications for accreditation under the Data Availability"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "and Transparency Act 2022 (1) An entity may apply for accreditation as an accredited user or an ADSP under section 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 on or after the day after the end of the period of 4 months beginning on the day this Act receives the Royal Assent. (2) However, an entity that is a Commonwealth body, a State body or a Territory body may apply for accreditation as an accredited user under section 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 on or after the day after the end of the period of 2 months beginning on the day this Act receives the Royal Assent. (3) Applications for accreditation as an accredited user or an ADSP under section 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 may not be made except in accordance with subitems (1) and (2).  Schedule 3  Transitional provisions  Data Availability and Transparency (Consequential Amendments) Act No. 12, 2022" ;
    skos:definition "and Transparency Act 2022 (1) An entity may apply for accreditation as an accredited user or an ADSP under section 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 on or after the day after the end of the period of 4 months beginning on the day this Act receives the Royal Assent. (2) However, an entity that is a Commonwealth body, a State body or a Territory body may apply for accreditation as an accredited user under section 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 on or after the day after the end of the period of 2 months beginning on the day this Act receives the Royal Assent. (3) Applications for accreditation as an accredited user or an ADSP under section 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 may not be made except in accordance with subitems (1) and (2).  Schedule 3  Transitional provisions  Data Availability and Transparency (Consequential Amendments) Act No. 12, 2022"@en ;
